      {
        "id": "textbook-os-why",
        "moduleId": "why-os-matters",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：汇编产物与操作系统有关",
        "markdown": "汇编语言本质上是机器码的可读版本：硬件相同，同一个程序的机器码就相同。但最终得到的可执行文件与操作系统有关——由操作系统决定如何装载、执行这些可执行文件，而且不同操作系统提供的库和系统调用并不完全相同。因此，只懂数学与硬件还不够，还要了解操作系统，才能更好地编写汇编语言。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000015"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统"
              ],
              "lineStart": 400,
              "lineEnd": 403,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "845e91a898155da97f76ec4898041417d65ee023e5e8ca6582c9512127acd90d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-os-bridge",
        "moduleId": "why-os-matters",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：指令相同，为什么程序不能随便跨系统搬",
        "markdown": "指令只规定 CPU 如何计算，而一个程序还要被装进内存、找到所需的库、向系统申请服务。装载方式、可用库和系统调用接口都由操作系统定义，所以同一份 ARM64 机器码不能在 macOS 与 Linux 之间直接互换运行。学汇编时关注操作系统，实际是在关注「程序如何被系统接纳」这一段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-os-why"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-macos-architecture",
        "moduleId": "macos-layers",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：macOS、Darwin 与 XNU 的关系",
        "markdown": "macOS 建立在 Darwin 操作系统之上，并以 Aqua 作为图形化界面；Darwin 操作系统的内核是 XNU。在教材给出的 macOS 基本架构图中，XNU 位于最底层的 Kernel and Device Drivers 层。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000016"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统",
                "Darwin与XNU"
              ],
              "lineStart": 404,
              "lineEnd": 431,
              "assetRefs": [
                "./assets/4-architecture.png",
                "./assets/4-uname.png",
                "./assets/4-xnu-architecture.gif"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "9c9598f338cf9383f73595a296a34edd72b53aed0609b9ac29a262e44acbe9d3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-darwin-not-macos",
        "moduleId": "macos-layers",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "澄清：macOS 不等于 Darwin",
        "markdown": "常见说法「macOS 就是 Darwin」并不准确。Darwin 是 macOS 依赖的操作系统部分，负责系统运行、内存分配这类底层能力；Aqua 是叠加其上的图形化界面。把两者混为一谈，就无法解释 macOS 中「底层系统」与「图形界面」分别归属的组合关系。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-macos-architecture"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-uname-and-openness",
        "moduleId": "version-and-openness",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "教材：查看版本与开源边界",
        "markdown": "在终端执行\n\n```bash\nuname -a\n```\n\n即可查看当前系统的 Darwin 与 XNU 版本号。XNU 是开源的，Apple 公开了其源码仓库；而 Aqua 图形化界面处于 Apple 专利之下。也就是说，macOS 里各种图案与交互属于 Apple 专有，而系统运行、内存分配等底层操作系统是开源的。社区也基于 Darwin 提供过 PureDarwin 这样的开源系统。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
