                "./assets/4-uname.png",
                "./assets/4-xnu-architecture.gif"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "9c9598f338cf9383f73595a296a34edd72b53aed0609b9ac29a262e44acbe9d3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-openness-check",
        "moduleId": "version-and-openness",
        "depth": "advanced",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "补充：用「能否读到源码」切分边界",
        "markdown": "遇到一个 macOS 组件时，可以先问：它的源码能读到吗？XNU 有公开仓库，属于可以阅读、研究和修改的底层；Aqua 的界面与交互受专利约束。这条边界也解释了为什么「读懂内核」与「复刻完整 macOS 体验」是两件事：前者是开源部分的研究，后者还涉及专有的图形层。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-uname-and-openness"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-xnu-composition",
        "moduleId": "xnu-composition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：XNU 是混合型内核",
        "markdown": "XNU 位于 macOS 的最底层，承担 Kernel and Device Drivers 的职责。总的来说，XNU 是一个混合型内核，其最重要的三个部分为 Mach、BSD 以及 IOKit。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
